{"id":"main_15_level_main_15-01_beg","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"50_g19_babeltop_ex2","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/AVG/m_avg_faceoff_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"(Unknown language) New redundant information?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","duration":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"All that remains is... nothingness?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"He looks at the rhombus, it appears to be—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#4$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"...An eye staring at me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"For the first time in his life, Theresis feels a shiver run down his spine."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"But it isn't his own instinctive reaction. He feels that a force, a will he can't see is trying to make him submit."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":0.9}},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_daoguang_zhixian_01_large","rox":60,"roy":20,"roz":50,"layer":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Be you a god, or my creator, come out and face me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Dead silence, cold. There is no response from the void."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Master. You shouldn't have come here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"'Ascalon'","text":"Her Highness has already made a terrible, reckless mistake. I do not want to lose another person I care about."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#7$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"'Ascalon'","text":"Master, leave this place. The time is not yet right."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"You should not use her to mock me, oh self-proclaimed Creator.","spans":[{"text":"You should not use her to mock me, oh self-proclaimed "},{"text":"Creator.","i":true}]},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The Ascalon standing before him is no illusion. This marvelous space has materialized his memories."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#8$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"In my memories, you are the same as before, just a little less mature."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"'Ascalon'","text":"...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Since those who truly control this place dare not face me directly, then Theresa has indeed succeeded. They must have already been subjected to numerous restrictions."},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Otherwise, those arrogant beings wouldn't have tried to get you to stop me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Theresis raises his sword."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"'Ascalon'","text":"You still do not wish to leave with me, Master?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"If you really want to take me away, then defeat me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"'Ascalon'","text":"As you wish."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_knifegore"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_daoguang_attack_02_small","layer":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_daoguang_spark_01_large","layer":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":0.9}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_swordtsing4","delay":0.1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_daoguang_zhixian_01_large","roy":20,"roz":292,"layer":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","duration":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":1,"focus":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"You're skilled, but you're merely using the skills I've taught you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":1.5,"afrom":1,"ato":0,"posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.1,"r":0.2,"g":0,"b":0.5,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"'Ascalon' disappears into a purple haze. She's used her Originium Arts."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Theresis thinks back to the day he and Theresa led the remnants of the Sarkaz army into that storm..."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The day he walked into the purple smoke alone and took the knife from that girl's hands... just as he does again."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#8$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"It has been some time, Ascalon."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}}]}
